 fix the bugs in the withdrawn releases 1.12.1 and 1.12.2 by repairing the database.\r\nTherefore, please inspect the release notes for 1.12.1 and 1.12.2 as well.\r\n\r\n**Note:** This release changes the local database to enforce uniqueness on the email column for local accounts.\r\nIn theory your instance should not have duplicate email addresses. However, it might be good to ensure this is\r\ntrue for your database as well and remove duplicate user entries otherwise.\r\n\r\nThe repair migrations - especially for SQLite - are a bit overcautious in order to not destroy any data.\r\nIn case your database has some weird situation which the repair does not recognize, it might abort and print a\r\nmessage to the log. So, please check your log on the first start of your instance after this update.\r\nAlso remember to create a backup before updating.\r\n\r\n### Security fixes\r\n\r\n- [GHSA-5q59-fhxv-4r9x](https://github.com/hedgedoc/hedgedoc/security/advisories/GHSA-5q59-fhxv-4r9x) reports a possible authorization check bypass when validating OAuth2 role or SAML group claims.\r\n\r\n### Bugfixes\r\n\r\n- Fixed the failing migrations of 1.12.1 and 1.12.2\r\n- Fixed registration breaking due to missing default values\r\n- Fixed login breaking due to a circular dependency import\r\n- Fixed permission check accessing invalid properties on realtime socket vs HTTP API\r\n- Fixed the first slide being printed as an empty page in Firefox\r\n- Fixed a crash on startup when `DATABASE_URL` is set and the config file has no section for the current environment, and `CMD_DB_URL` now takes precedence over the legacy `DATABASE_URL`\r\n\r\n### Contributors\r\n\r\n- [Patrick Lühne](https://github.com/pluehne)\r\n- [Sri Venkateswaran](https://github.com/srivenkateswaran6002)\r\n- [maluyckx](https://github.com/maluyckx)\r\n- [Mayuri Phad](https://github.com/mayuriphad)","upstream_url":"https://github.com/hedgedoc/hedgedoc/releases/tag/1.12.3"},"config":{"env":["PATH=/lsiopy/bin:/usr/local/sbin:/usr/local/bin:/usr/sbin:/usr/bin:/sbin:/bin","PS1=$(whoami)@$(hostname):$(pwd)\\$ ","HOME=/root","TERM=xterm","S6_CMD_WAIT_FOR_SERVICES_MAXTIME=0","S6_VERBOSITY=1","S6_STAGE2_HOOK=/docker-mods","VIRTUAL_ENV=/lsiopy","LSIO_FIRST_PARTY=true","NODE_ENV=production","PUPPETEER_SKIP_DOWNLOAD=true","YARN_CACHE_FOLDER=/tmp/.yarn"],"exposed_ports":["3000/tcp"],"volumes":["/config"],"entrypoint":["/init"],"working_dir":"/"},"is_newest":true,"links":{"build":"https://linuxserver-playground.github.io/hub/api/v1/catalog/hedgedoc/builds/1.12.3-ls12.json","diff":"https://linuxserver-playground.github.io/hub/api/v1/catalog/hedgedoc/builds/1.12.3-ls12/diff.json","layers":{"amd64":"https://linuxserver-playground.github.io/hub/api/v1/catalog/hedgedoc/builds/1.12.3-ls12/layers.amd64.json","arm64":"https://linuxserver-playground.github.io/hub/api/v1/catalog/hedgedoc/builds/1.12.3-ls12/layers.arm64.json"},"packages":{"amd64":"https://linuxserver-playground.github.io/hub/api/v1/catalog/hedgedoc/builds/1.12.3-ls12/packages.amd64.json","arm64":"https://linuxserver-playground.github.io/hub/api/v1/catalog/hedgedoc/builds/1.12.3-ls12/packages.arm64.json"},"release":"https://github.com/linuxserver-playground/docker-hedgedoc/releases/tag/1.12.3-ls12","pages":"https://linuxserver-playground.github.io/docker-hedgedoc/builds/1.12.3-ls12/","files":{"amd64":"https://linuxserver-playground.github.io/docker-hedgedoc/builds/1.12.3-ls12/files.amd64.json.gz","arm64":"https://linuxserver-playground.github.io/docker-hedgedoc/builds/1.12.3-ls12/files.arm64.json.gz"},"sbom":{"amd64":"https://linuxserver-playground.github.io/docker-hedgedoc/builds/1.12.3-ls12/packages.amd64.json.gz","arm64":"https://linuxserver-playground.github.io/docker-hedgedoc/builds/1.12.3-ls12/packages.arm64.json.gz"},"run_json":"https://github.com/linuxserver-playground/docker-hedgedoc/releases/download/1.12.3-ls12/run.json","logs_zip":"https://github.com/linuxserver-playground/docker-hedgedoc/releases/download/1.12.3-ls12/logs.zi